EEXXIITT SSTTAATTUUSS
     The ggzziipp utility exits with one of the following values:

           0       Success.
           1       An error occurred.
           2       At least one of the specified files was not compressed
                   since --ff was not specified and compression would have re‐
                   sulted in a size increase.
           >2      An error occurred.

     The gguunnzziipp and ggzzccaatt utilities exit 0 on success, and >0 if an error oc‐
     curs.

